### Daily backend smoke test
### Run top to bottom against a fresh daily schema. Requires an HTTP client
### that supports .http files (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client),
### or translate each block to curl manually.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1a. Signup step 1 — email a verification code
### (with MAIL_HOST unset the code is printed in the backend log instead)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "email": "ravi@example.com"
}

### 1b. Signup step 2 — create the account with the code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessName": "Sharma Medical Store",
  "ownerName": "Ravi Sharma",
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "email": "ravi@example.com",
  "otp": "123456",
  "password": "password123",
  "businessType": "MEDICAL_STORE"
}

### 1c. Forgot password — email a reset code to the account's address
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210"
}

### 1d. Reset password with the code (returns a token, like login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "otp": "123456",
  "newPassword": "password123"
}

### 2. Login (capture the token from the response and set it below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Get business profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/business
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Add a sale (amount only — must be fast, no other required fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/sale
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 450
}

### 5. List categories (triggers lazy default seeding for MEDICAL_STORE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Add an expense with a category
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/expense
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 120,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 7. Today's dashboard — should show sales=450, expenses=120, profit=330
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Monthly report for the current month
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/monthly?year=2026&month=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Multi-business: create a second business (resend with the same clientId → same business, no duplicate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/business
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessName": "Sharma Car Showroom",
  "businessType": "OTHER",
  "clientId": "smoke-test-showroom"
}

### 10. List all businesses (set {{businessId}} to the new business's id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/business/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Add a sale to the second business
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/sale
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: {{businessId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000
}

### 12. Login business is unchanged without the header — still sales=450
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. All Businesses dashboard — totalSales=50450, one summary per business
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Another user's business id → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: 999999
